Sentence|Translation
Jau na sun ni Simon ni James|I am neither Simon nor James
Ti na vuls ni ina tomata ni in chaun|You want neither a tomato or a (male) dog
Vus stais gugent en Tirchia|You (pl) like living in Turkey
Ha el gugent ina sora?|Does he like having a sister?
Jau fatsch guguent pasta cun mia tatta|I like making pasta with my grandmother
Ella na stat ni en in'abitaziun ni en ina chasa|She lives neither in an apartment nor in a house
Mes frar na è ni maltgiert ni popular|My brother is neither ugly nor popular